      "hints": [
        "Substitute $f(x) = 2x^2 + 3$ into itself: $ff(x) = 2(2x^2 + 3)^2 + 3$.",
        "Expand and simplify."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Form the composite function $ff(x) = f(f(x))$ with $f(x) = 2x^2 + 3$:\n$$ff(x) = 2(2x^2 + 3)^2 + 3$$",
        "Expand the squared term:\n$$(2x^2 + 3)^2 = 4x^4 + 12x^2 + 9$$",
        "Multiply by 2 and add 3:\n$$ff(x) = 2(4x^4 + 12x^2 + 9) + 3 = 8x^4 + 24x^2 + 18 + 3 = 8x^4 + 24x^2 + 21$$"
      ],
